      "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mVYsh4_7tPnhk4WYSdJnsULsk1BHYmbthLeH2eoiV5JeggNIweaGnRuf_CWe9Mf5bHig=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
      "text": "琵琶湖から来てるのでは？",
